			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Nighthaven is the only village of {link:moonglade}Moonglade{/link}, built along the shores of {link:lake-elune-ara}Lake Elune'ara{/link}. Its houses are raised in the old style of the night elves, and beside them stand the tents of the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} druids who have joined the Circle. {link:rabine-saturna}Rabine Saturna{/link} keeps the affairs of the village for {link:keeper-remulos}Keeper Remulos{/link}. {link:dendrite-starblaze}Dendrite Starblaze{/link} and {link:loganaar}Loganaar{/link} teach the young druids who come here, and the archivist {link:umber}Umber{/link} wanders among his shelves. Riders of the Circle carry druids to {link:darnassus}Darnassus{/link} and to {link:thunder-bluff}Thunder Bluff{/link}, while hippogryphs and wind riders wait at the edges of the glade. Nighthaven is remote and keeps to itself. Only at the Lunar Festival does it open its arms to all the peoples of the world.]=],
