			text = [=[Lake Elune'ara fills the heart of {link:moonglade}Moonglade{/link}. It bears the name of Elune, and its clear, deep waters reflect the moon over the glade. {link:nighthaven}Nighthaven{/link} stands on its shores, and bridges cross it where the land narrows. The lake is part of the teaching of the Circle. Young druids dive into its depths in search of shrine baubles, which fade quickly once brought into the air. The lake also keeps an older secret. It is said that the fallen wolf Omen sleeps in its silt, blessed by Elune and unable to die.]=],
