				{ type = "quest", id = 6762 },
			},
			text = [=[When the Circle asked for aid in the far west, the call went out through {link:thunder-bluff}Thunder Bluff{/link} and through {link:darnassus}Darnassus{/link}. In Thunder Bluff it was heard gladly. In Darnassus the Arch Druid refused to hear it himself. He warned that {link:moonglade}Moonglade{/link} spoke only propaganda, and that he alone had led his people out of the dark. His own second admitted that the Arch Druid and the keeper each suspected the other of trickery. Those who came to the glade anyway were promised that they stood among friends, and that no harm from Darnassus would reach them there.]=],
