			},
			text = [=[Deep in Maraudon, where Theradras kept his remains, the spirit of Zaetar lingered. He would not leave his children, even after all they had done. He sent instead the first seed that had grown from the life his remains had fed, with a message for his brother: that his spirit endured there. When the seed reached {link:moonglade}Moonglade{/link}, Remulos understood. His brother had not been lost. He had given himself back to nature, as was his duty, and found peace at last. The keeper sensed that the seed would matter one day to the people of that war-torn land.]=],
