			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Dendrite keeps the oldest tradition of the druids: that the shapes of nature must be earned, not simply granted. He sends his students to the great spirits, into the lake and among the sick beasts of the world, and judges them by what they bring back. Now druids of the {link:skyborne}shen'dorei{/link} come to him too.]=],
