			text = [=[{link:auberdine}Auberdine{/link} had asked {link:moonglade}Moonglade{/link} for aid, and Dendrite made it a lesson. This was no exercise, he warned. The water of {link:cliffspring-falls}Cliffspring Falls{/link} was poisoning the deer of {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}, and the student had to cure them by hand, as a layman would, before learning to do it with a word. Auberdine sent back its thanks. Dendrite added a warning of his own: some in {link:darnassus}Darnassus{/link} choose not to see the corruption spreading through the land.]=],
